msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"(...Hey, what about her? As far as being a hostess goes, she\r\n"
"might be a good fit. Let's see here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"(She seems clever enough for the job... Very friendly, too.\r\n"
"And she's also quite motivated... but I feel like she'll get\r\n"
"stressed out pretty easily... Should I go with her?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "(On second thought... maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Ripensandoci... Magari no.)"

msgctxt "172"
msgid "(Okay, let's see what I can come up with...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Excuse me, miss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Ah, I like that answer. But isn't it a little to early to\r\n"
"agree? I haven't even asked you my question yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha, shut up! That's like... the lamest thing ever...\r\n"
"But somehow I don't mind, coming from you. So what,\r\n"
"are you trying to pick me up or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Actually, I'm trying to find hostesses for my club.\r\n"
"I want uncut diamonds that glimmer in the night.\r\n"
"Like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Hah! Well if that's not the cheesiest line I've ever heard,\r\n"
"then I don't know what is! ...But... I like cheesy lines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... Weeelll... I am pretty free as it is... so...\r\n"
"Okay! I might as well go check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Thank you. My name's Kiryu, by the way... Kazuma Kiryu.\r\n"
"Please let me show you to the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Lead the way. Oh, but before that, I'm Hiromi. 21 years old,\r\n"
"and I know I might not look like it, but I wanna be a pasta\r\n"
"chef someday. Maybe. Anyway, it's super nice to meet you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Approach Her"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Hold That Thought"
msgstr ""

